
=== 01_build_dataset.py ===
Raw series: 21 (+ diesel in EUR)
Feature groups: Momentum (returns) (33), Futures curve (4), Refining margin (2), Volatility (8), Inflation expectations (4), Price level (2), Past outcomes (2), Seasonality (2)
Model dataset: 4701 days x 57 features, 2008-01-02 -> 2026-10-15; spike rate 0.192

